### Rider HTTP Client: відкрийте файл і натискайте ▶ біля запитів. Запускайте зверху вниз.
@host = http://localhost:5080
###@categoryId = 7c1d0f52-3a55-4b0e-8d61-2f0a9e4b1c01
###@habitId = 5e9b7a10-6c2d-4f3a-9b84-1d7e3c5a2b02
@categoryId = 2b6f4c18-9e07-4d3a-b5a1-8c0d7e1f3a44
@habitId = 6a8c1d22-4e7b-4f90-a3d5-2b9e0c4f7a55
@taskA = 9d4e2a10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-7c8d9e0f1a21
@taskB = 9d4e2a10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-7c8d9e0f1a22
@taskC = 9d4e2a10-1b3c-4e5f-8a6b-7c8d9e0f1a23

### 1. Реєстрація (повторно дасть 409 — це нормально)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test User", "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### 2. Вхід — токен збережеться в змінну
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); client.global.set("refresh", response.body.refreshToken); %}

### 3. Категорія (upsert) — потрібна для завдання A
PUT {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study", "colorHex": "#4C8BF5", "icon": "book", "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T08:00:00Z" }

### 4. Список категорій / дельта
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/categories?modifiedSince=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Завдання A: Critical, з категорією, оцінкою 90 хв
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit report before deadline",
  "description": null,
  "deadlineUtc": "2026-11-12T09:00:00Z",
  "priority": 3,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "reminderAtUtc": null,
  "completedAtUtc": null,
  "estimatedMinutes": 90,
  "subtasks": [ { "id": "aa111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "title": "Draft", "isDone": true } ],
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T09:00:00Z"
}

### 5-B. Завдання B: Medium, без категорії і дедлайну
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskB}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Read a chapter",
  "description": null,
  "deadlineUtc": null,
  "priority": 1,
  "categoryId": null,
  "reminderAtUtc": null,
  "completedAtUtc": null,
  "estimatedMinutes": 30,
  "subtasks": [],
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T09:00:00Z"
}

### 5-C. Завдання C: прострочене (шар 1)
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskC}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pay the invoice",
  "description": null,
  "deadlineUtc": "2026-11-09T12:00:00Z",
  "priority": 2,
  "categoryId": null,
  "reminderAtUtc": null,
  "completedAtUtc": null,
  "estimatedMinutes": null,
  "subtasks": [],
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T09:00:00Z"
}

### 5a. Відкладання: дедлайн A пізніше → подія TaskPostponed
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit report before deadline",
  "description": null,
  "deadlineUtc": "2026-11-14T09:00:00Z",
  "priority": 3,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "reminderAtUtc": null,
  "completedAtUtc": null,
  "estimatedMinutes": 90,
  "subtasks": [],
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z"
}

### 6. Список завдань / дельта
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?modifiedSince=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Звичка (щодня)
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Morning run",
  "description": null,
  "frequencyType": 0,
  "daysOfWeekMask": 0,
  "timesPerWeek": null,
  "reminderTime": "07:30:00",
  "colorHex": "#5BB97C",
  "icon": "run",
  "categoryId": null,
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T08:00:00Z"
}

### 8. Відмітка за день (тіло необов'язкове); повтор не дублює подію
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/logs/2026-11-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/logs/2026-11-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "completedAtUtc": "2026-11-09T06:45:00Z" }

### 9. Зняти відмітку
DELETE {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/logs/2026-11-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Звички / дельта
GET {{host}}/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/habits?modifiedSince=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Ранжування (створює ключі рекомендацій для перших 3 завдань)
GET {{host}}/api/recommendations/ranking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% if (response.body.ranked && response.body.ranked.length > 0) { client.global.set("recKey", response.body.ranked[0].recommendationKey); } %}

### 14. Відгук: прийнято (action: 0 — Accepted, 1 — Rejected, 2 — Postponed)
POST {{host}}/api/recommendations/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recommendationKey": "{{recKey}}", "action": 0 }

### 15. Той самий відгук повторно → { "applied": false }
POST {{host}}/api/recommendations/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recommendationKey": "{{recKey}}", "action": 0 }

### 11. Видалення (м'яке) — запускайте в кінці
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskB}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Оновлення токенів
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }